author: maintainer-agent
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "update-many and close-many are reachable as facets of update/close with identical semantics including dry-run parity and validate-close; delete and restore live under exactly one noun per the accepted ADR; old spellings alias-dispatch with hints; spelling-parity spec green; contracts, completions, docs, and MCP names regenerated."
parent: pm-n7rr
risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: "Added update many, close many and close delete through shared namespace contracts, preserving permanent aliases, rollback semantics, history restore and ops test-all placement, completions and item addressing."
expected_result: Native lifecycle leaves retain legacy bulk behavior and recovery without widening compact discovery or weakening safety and quality gates.
actual_result: "657 files and 8656 tests passed with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage; native/legacy parity, rollback, restore, linked tests, package consumers, static/docs/type and grammar/discovery gates passed."
